1
00:00:00,627 --> 00:00:02,457
(Penny:)-Maybe you'll have another chance--
-No.

2
00:00:02,629 --> 00:00:05,879
(Sheldon:)I will never have another chance
to have gelato with Stan Lee...

3
00:00:06,049 --> 00:00:08,719
(Sheldon:)...because opportunities
to have gelato with Stan Lee...

4
00:00:08,885 --> 00:00:10,425
(Sheldon:)...come but once in a lifetime.

5
00:00:10,595 --> 00:00:15,725
(Sheldon:)The moving finger writes
and, having writ, moves on.

6
00:00:20,689 --> 00:00:23,859
(Penny:)Did he just somehow
give me the finger?

7
00:00:24,442 --> 00:00:27,992
(Howard:)Not just the finger, the moving finger.

8
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:33,080
(Leonard:)Hey, Stuart.

9
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:36,910
(Stuart:)Oh, hey, Penny. Wow.

10
00:00:37,247 --> 00:00:38,877
(Scene:)Hi.

11
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,500
(Leonard:)-What's going on?
-Nothing.

12
00:00:40,667 --> 00:00:45,337
(Stuart:)I'm just getting ready to close up
and head out.

13
00:00:45,505 --> 00:00:50,305
(Penny:)-Cool. Got any fun plans?
-Oh, yeah. Big night tonight.

14
00:00:50,593 --> 00:00:54,933
(Stuart:)Gonna share a can of tuna
with the cat.

15
00:00:55,098 --> 00:00:56,928
(Penny:)Oh, nice.

16
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:04,020
(Stuart:)Not even my cat. I just feed it.
Some nights, it doesn't even show up.

